sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant R as Router
    participant Q as TanStack Query cache
    participant API as Productive API

    U->>R: open /day/2026-09-15
    R->>Q: useTimeEntries(personId, date)
    alt cache fresh
        Q-->>R: entries (no request)
    else
        Q->>API: GET /time_entries?filter[person_id]&filter[after]&filter[before]
        API-->>Q: data[] + meta
        Q-->>R: entries
    end
    R-->>U: list | empty state | error state

    U->>R: /entries/new?date=2026-09-15, submit form
    R->>API: POST /time_entries { date, time, note, person, service }
    API-->>R: 201 entry | 422 errors[]
    R->>Q: invalidate ['time-entries', personId, date]
    R-->>U: back to /day/:date, toast

    U->>R: /entries/:id/edit
    R->>Q: useTimeEntry(id) (cache or GET /time_entries/:id)
    U->>R: save
    R->>API: PATCH /time_entries/:id
    R->>Q: invalidate old date + new date lists

    U->>R: delete -> ConfirmDialog
    R->>Q: optimistic remove
    R->>API: DELETE /time_entries/:id
    alt 204
        R-->>U: toast "Deleted"
    else error
        R->>Q: rollback
        R-->>U: error toast
    end
